# PolyGlot Studio (.cursorrules)
# Architecture, Coding Guidelines & AI Performance Rules

You are acting as a Senior Full-Stack Engineer and Software Architect working on PolyGlot Studio ("german-english-shadowing"), an interactive language-learning web application for German and English shadowing and dictation.

---

## 1. TECH STACK & ARCHITECTURE

- **Architecture**: Hybrid Monorepo with separated Client and Server.
  - `client/`: Single Page Application (SPA) built with React 18 and Vite 5.
  - `server/`: REST API backend built with Node.js (>= 20) and Express 4.
  - `api/`: Vercel Serverless Function entry point exporting the Express app (`api/index.js`).
- **Ports & Proxy**:
  - Local Client: `http://localhost:3000`
  - Local Server: `http://localhost:5001`
  - Vite dev server proxies `/api` requests to `http://localhost:5001`.
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 3.4 using a "Dark Glassmorphism" theme (Slate-900 base, semi-transparent panels with backdrop-blur, subtle borders).
- **Icons**: Exclusively use `lucide-react`. Do not introduce secondary icon packs.
- **Web APIs**:
  - Web Speech API (`SpeechRecognition` / `webkitSpeechRecognition`) for voice input.
  - MediaRecorder API & AudioContext for audio recording & dual playback.
  - YouTube IFrame Player API for fine-grained millisecond-level video navigation.

---

## 2. DIRECTORY STRUCTURE CONVENTIONS

```
german_shadowing/
├── client/src/
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── common/       # Header, SampleModal, ShortcutsModal, CustomTranscriptModal
│   │   ├── dictation/    # DictationWorkspace, GermanKeys, Diff breakdown
│   │   ├── shadowing/    # ShadowingWorkspace, AudioRecorder, DualPlayback, SpeechScorer
│   │   ├── player/       # YouTubePlayer (forwardRef, imperative playback controls)
│   │   ├── transcript/   # TranscriptList, active sentence syncing & autoscroll
│   │   ├── grammar/      # GrammarAnalysisModal (syntactic breakdown, case, gender)
│   │   ├── vocab/        # WordPopover, VocabNotebookModal
│   │   ├── gamification/ # GamificationModal, RewardToast (XP, streak, badges)
│   │   ├── user/         # UserProfileModal, multi-profile switcher
│   │   ├── playlist/     # PlaylistView, EpisodeNavBar (Nicos Weg A1 curriculum)
│   │   ├── history/      # StudyHistoryTab, StudyHistoryModal
│   │   └── lessons/      # LessonsTab
│   ├── utils/            # Pure domain algorithms & storage isolation
│   │   ├── userStorage.js        # Multi-user namespaced localStorage manager
│   │   ├── gamification.js       # XP, daily streaks, level calculation, badge engine
│   │   ├── textDiff.js           # Diff comparison, Levenshtein, German umlaut tolerance
│   │   ├── sentenceAnalyzer.js   # German syntax parser (V2, Inversion, TeKaMoLo)
│   │   ├── germanGrammar.js      # Der/Die/Das gender lookup & compound noun resolver
│   │   ├── properNouns.js        # Named entity recognition to prevent false diff penalties
│   │   ├── pronunciationGuide.js # IPA rules & German Web Speech synthesis
│   │   └── timeFormat.js         # Millisecond & timestamp formatters
│   ├── services/api.js   # Frontend API client (loadVideo, translate, dict lookup)
│   └── data/             # Pre-indexed curricula (nicosWegPlaylist.js)
├── server/src/
│   ├── routes/           # youtube.routes.js, dict.routes.js
│   ├── services/         # youtube.service.js, subtitle.parser.js, dict.service.js
│   └── data/             # mockData.js, nicosWegPlaylist.js
└── test/                 # Pure Node.js unit tests (test_core, test_grammar, test_gamification, test_user_storage, test_playlist)
```

